OL,3,GNEWSAPlea as flu and Covid-19 vaccine
OL,4,Aprogramme begins
OL,5,
OL,6,FEligible people in Leicestershire and
OL,7,FRutland have been urged to book in for
OL,8,Ftheir free flu and Covid-19
OL,9,Fvaccinations.
OL,11,FNHS bosses said they "really do save
OL,12,Flives" ahead of the annual programme of
OL,13,Fvaccinations beginning in the area on
OL,14,FThursday.
OL,16,FPeople including over 65s, pregnant
OL,17,Fwomen, care home residents and the
OL,18,Fclinically-vulnerable have been urged
OL,19,Fto get the jabs ahead of the winter
OL,20,Fmonths.
OL,23,APub: 01-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,364,360,200,160,0,100
