OL,3,GNEWSAPlea as flu and Covid-19 vaccine
OL,4,Aprogramme begins
OL,5,
OL,6,FDr Nil Sanganee, chief medical officer
OL,7,Fof the local NHS Integrated Care Board,
OL,8,Fsaid it was "vitally important" to
OL,9,Fprotect those that need it most to help
OL,10,Fprevent the spread of harmful viruses.
